Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}私と勝負よ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来跟我一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.06,0:16:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}望むところよ！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}なんということだ…。\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会这样……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}犬と猫人間の戦いから→\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从狗与猫人的战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
